# Story: someone with a German keyboard. The menu says ⌃⌥A, ⌃⌥F, ⌃⌥D and those are the keys with these letters on
# them; Back is on the key where a US keyboard has [, which is labelled Ü here, and the menu says so.
# Then a French keyboard, where the digits need ⇧ to type and the saved views stay on the digit keys.
# Written by the executor swarm (F44); for the documenter to review. Reference: A64.
open Safari
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+[ shows ⌃⌥[
keyboard german
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+a key 0
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+a shows ⌃⌥A
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+[ key 33
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+[ shows ⌃⌥Ü
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+] shows ⌃⌥+
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+space shows ⌃⌥Space
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+cmd+left shows ⌃⌥⌘←
keyboard french
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+a key 12
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+a shows ⌃⌥A
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+1 key 18
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+1 shows ⌃⌥1
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+shift+1 shows ⌃⌥⇧1
keyboard dvorak
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+d key 4
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+[ key 27
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+[ shows ⌃⌥[
keyboard us
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+a key 0
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+[ shows ⌃⌥[
